sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Agent AI · A successful request in source
    accDescr: On main, Express completes the PDF answer before starting the web answer. The document answer and web answer are returned in separate fields.
    participant U as React
    participant A as Express
    participant L as OpenAI
    participant M as MCP server
    participant W as SerpAPI
    U->>A: POST /upload · PDF
    U->>A: GET /chat · Question
    Note over A,L: Document path first
    A->>A: Extract + split
    A->>L: Embed text + query
    L-->>A: Vectors
    A->>A: Retrieve passages
    A->>L: Question + passages
    L-->>A: Document answer
    Note over A,W: Then search the web
    A->>M: search_web · stdio
    M->>W: Same question
    W-->>M: Search results
    M-->>A: Tool result
    A->>L: Summarize web results
    L-->>A: Web answer
    A-->>U: ragAnswer + mcpAnswer
